+determine which multicast data packets to forward via the tunnel
+to the mobile node.</li>
+          <li pn="section-8.4-2.13">Home agents <bcp14>MAY</bcp14> support stateful address autoconfiguration for
+mobile nodes as described in <xref target="section-10.4.4" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 10.4.4"/>.</li>
         </ul>
