+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.2">The node <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> support sending packets containing a Home Address
+option (<xref target="section-11.3.1" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.3.1"/>), and follow the required IPsec interaction
+(<xref target="section-11.3.2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.3.2"/>).</li>
