+formation, and returning home (<xref target="section-11.5" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.5"/>).</li>
+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.8">The node <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be able to process Mobility Headers as described in
+<xref target="section-11.2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.2"/>.</li>
