+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.10">The node <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be able to send Binding Updates, as specified in
+<xref target="section-11.7.1" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.7.1"/> and <xref target="section-11.7.2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.7.2"/>.</li>
+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.11">The node <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be able to receive and process Binding
+Acknowledgements, as specified in <xref target="section-11.7.3" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.7.3"/>.</li>
+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.12">The node <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> support receiving a Binding Refresh Request (<xref target="section-6.1.2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 6.1.2"/>), by responding with a Binding Update.</li>
+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.13">The node <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> support receiving Mobile Prefix Advertisements
+(<xref target="section-11.4.3" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.4.3"/>) and reconfiguring its home address based on the
+prefix information contained therein.</li>
+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.14">The node <bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14> support use of the dynamic home agent address
+discovery mechanism, as described in <xref target="section-11.4.1" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 11.4.1"/>.</li>
+          <li pn="section-8.5-2.15">The node <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> allow route optimization to be administratively
+enabled or disabled.  The default <bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14> be enabled.</li>
